{"mode":"test","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the text. Then go to Exercise.<\/p>","english":""},"content":"<p><custom-image id=\"custom-image_0\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p>Hello! I\u2019m Sam. I\u2019ve got a new pet and I\u2019m very happy. My pet is a baby rabbit. Her name is Ruby. Baby rabbits are called kittens, or kits.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><custom-image id=\"custom-image_1\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p>Hi! My name\u2019s Vera. My pet is a budgie. His name is Billy. Billy is blue, black and white. Budgies live from 5 to 10 years. Billy is 8!<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><custom-image id=\"custom-image_2\"><\/custom-image><\/p><p>Hi! I\u2019m Oli and I haven\u2019t got a pet, but my best friend Benji has got a really cool cat. His name is Craig. He\u2019s grey and he's got green eyes. Guess what? There are over 500 million pet cats in the world!<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Have you got a pet? What is it?<\/p>","showOnStart":true,"configs":[{"id":"custom-image_0","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"read_rabbit.png","width":300,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""},{"id":"custom-image_1","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"read_budgie.png","width":300,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""},{"id":"custom-image_2","type":"custom-image","url":"","name":"read_cat.png","width":300,"margin":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0},"float":"none","style":""}]},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p><b>Choose the correct words.<\/b><\/p>","english":""},"configs":[{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"Ruby","correct":true},{"answer":"Billy","correct":false}],"id":"dropdown_0","type":"dropdown","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/options_1\/options_1_2023_cyber_homework\/unit_02_CH_08\/unit_02_reading_01_ch_08\/"},{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"is","correct":true},{"answer":"isn\u2019t","correct":false}],"id":"dropdown_1","type